Package: y5-compositor
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 y5-compositor-settings,
 mesa-vulkan-drivers,
 ffmpeg,
 xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Recommends:
 y5-polkit-agent,
 y5-xwayland-satellite,
 vulkan-tools,
 mesa-utils
Suggests:
 y5-compositor-monitor,
 y5-mx-gesture-daemon,
 y5-compositor-full
Description: Y5 Wayland compositor (core session)
 y5 is a Wayland compositor with a pannable/zoomable desktop and screen
 capture.
 .
 This package installs the DRM/KMS compositor binary, the display-manager
 session entry, systemd user units for the session, PAM, and portal config.
 .
 Run `y5.compositor.settings` (from y5-compositor-settings) before the first
 session to create ~/.config/y5.compositor/settings.json.
 .
 For the previous all-in-one bundle, install y5-compositor-full.

Package: y5-compositor-settings
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
