 ${misc:Depends}
Breaks: y5-compositor (<< 1.4.1-1ubuntu1)
Replaces: y5-compositor (<< 1.4.1-1ubuntu1)
Description: Settings editor for Y5 Compositor
 GUI/tool used to author a complete
 ~/.config/y5.compositor/settings.json before starting a Y5 session.

