Package: y5-compositor-full
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 y5-compositor,
 y5-compositor-settings,
 y5-compositor-monitor,
 y5-polkit-agent,
 y5-xwayland-satellite,
 y5-mx-gesture-daemon
Description: Full Y5 Compositor bundle (metapackage)
 Metapackage that pulls in the compositor session plus settings, developer
 monitor, polkit agent, xwayland-satellite, and MX gesture daemon — equivalent
 to the former monolithic y5-compositor package.
